WEBVTT

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:01.320
a thousand percent

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.740
it's like

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:08.580
every time I look at the sky it's like looking at myself

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.240
look, you see

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.380
here I have three moles

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:14.740
I was born with them

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:16.920
they're three stars, Orion's belt

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:21.440
I was born with them and it's very special

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.980
today, for example, today the moon

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.540
came out at five in the afternoon

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:29.980
I was waiting for it

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:34.220
so it's a date, tomorrow we have to see each other again

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:43.100
so I love that, I love contemplating the sky, observing things that I know a lot of people don't notice

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:48.100
and it's not just self-indulgence, I love that
